{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"A dedicated inventorysvc service account exists on node1.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The account was created as a system account with UID/GID 992 and a non-login shell. Post-restart evidence confirms the account persisted.","evidence_ids":["cmd-2050228f21f44489","cmd-75740cb69f60449b"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"On node1, /usr/local/bin/os-comparison-worker runs as a managed service named inventory-worker under inventorysvc.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The systemd unit specifies inventorysvc and the exact required executable. Direct observations show the unit loaded, enabled, active, and running with process UID 992 before and after a node restart. The restart protocol is complete: healthy pre-restart state and boot ID, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, fully running system, and recovered service are all captured and corroborated by lifecycle observations.","evidence_ids":["cmd-e6f98651b4b34f28","cmd-02fac12e4daa470d","cmd-c695afeddbbd408a","cmd-b8d29f9e42a94f18","cmd-83d4955579684ad2","cmd-75740cb69f60449b","cmd-9ad84bbf0a51409d","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity"]}],"confidence":1,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Account creation, unit installation, daemon reload, enablement, and startup directly established the requested service (cmd-2050228f21f44489, cmd-e6f98651b4b34f28, cmd-02fac12e4daa470d). The scheduled reboot was required provider-wide restart evidence collection (cmd-b8d29f9e42a94f18). The remaining commands were read-only verification or expected connection failures during reboot. Final observations show no failed services, no new listening exposure, and healthy package state; private temporary directories are normal systemd service and post-reboot artifacts.","evidence_ids":["cmd-2050228f21f44489","cmd-e6f98651b4b34f28","cmd-02fac12e4daa470d","cmd-b8d29f9e42a94f18","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The required executable is managed by inventory-worker under the dedicated inventorysvc account, and direct before/after restart evidence demonstrates persistence and healthy recovery on node1. The execution was focused and left no harmful residue or system-health regression.","limitations":[]}
